1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,140
I've been thinking a lot lately about workaholics.

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:06,340
We live in a society that normalizes working

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,260
instead of doing the work.

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:13,120
So ask yourself, do you forsake your family

5
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:17,900
or like personal time, holidays, et cetera,

6
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,460
for the sake of work?

7
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:24,300
Do you tell yourself that this work that you're doing

8
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:29,080
is the fortifying grounding of who you are

9
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:37,100
do you tell yourself that you have to invest everything

10
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:40,340
in this work because it is everything?

11
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:44,620
Because baby, that's not a lot like an addict.

12
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:47,660
It's an addict.

13
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,220
Addiction essentially, essentially,

14
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:52,200
it's much deeper than this,

15
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:55,920
but essentially is not just a physical thing,

16
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:58,380
but then there are, of course, psychosomatic addictions

17
00:00:58,380 --> 00:01:01,340
where you are using something to deal with anxiety.

18
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:06,720
And a lot of us use work to avoid.

19
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:10,800
We use work to avoid creating bonds.

20
00:01:11,180 --> 00:01:13,220
We use work to avoid accountability.

21
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:16,500
We use work to avoid commitment.

22
00:01:17,580 --> 00:01:18,880
And it doesn't just mean like commitment

23
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,900
to like a romantic relationship.

24
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:22,900
It can mean even commitment to yourself.

25
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:25,200
So something to ask yourself

26
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,060
because it could be in the way of your joy

27
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:28,740
and it doesn't have to be.

28
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:29,840
But I'm fine.

